{
    "title": "Corporate Governance Certificate and BRSR General Disclosures for SBI Life",
    "summary": "The page contains two main sections. First, a corporate governance certificate by Aashish K. Bhatt & Associates for SBI Life Insurance Company Limited, certifying compliance with SEBI Listing Regulations, 2015 for April 1, 2024 to March 31, 2025, including responsibilities, scope, and disclaimers. Second, Section A: General Disclosures from a Business Responsibility and Sustainability Report (BRSR), covering details of the listed entity such as CIN, name, incorporation year, addresses, contact details, financial year, stock exchanges, paid-up capital, reporting contact, reporting boundary, assurance provider, and type of assurance. It also includes products/services details: business activities (financial and insurance services, 100% turnover from life insurance) and product/service NIC code 65110 contributing 100% of turnover.",
}

{
    "summary": "The text presents SBI Life Insurance Company Limited's financial statements for FY 2024-25, including the Profit and Loss Account (Form A-PL) and Balance Sheet (Form A-BS) with comparatives for FY 2023-24. It details the Shareholders' Non-technical Account, showing income from investments, expenses, contributions to policyholders, tax, profit after tax, appropriations, and earnings per share. The Balance Sheet outlines sources of funds (shareholders' funds, policyholders' funds, fair value change accounts, funds for future appropriations, deferred tax) and application of funds (investments, loans, fixed assets, current assets/liabilities, net current assets). Contingent liabilities are disclosed. Signatures of auditors and directors are included, along with notes and schedules referenced.",
}
